                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Which POS is best for Indian restaurants?</h3>
                                        <p>Petpooja (widest adoption), POSist (enterprise), Rista (mid-market). Test all three before committing.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I use Urbanpiper for delivery aggregation?</h3>
                                        <p>For 5+ outlets with 3+ delivery partners each, yes. Below that, direct integration works.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does restaurant tech cost?</h3>
                                        <p>Single outlet: ₹35K-150K hardware + ₹3K-15K/month SaaS. Chain: ₹5-25 lakh one-time + ₹40K-200K/month. Enterprise custom: ₹80 lakh - 3 Cr build.</p>
                                        <h3>Cloud kitchen requires different tech?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — multi-brand ops, aggregator dispatch, virtual brand management. Otter, Urbanpiper, Petpooja Cloud are specialised for this.</p>
